TkMacos

TkMacos is derived from tkmacosx, originally created by Saad Mairaj.
Copyright 2021 Saad Mairaj.
Original project: https://github.com/Saadmairaj/tkmacosx

The original work is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0; see
LICENSE. The following changes are made in this fork:

- The distribution and import package names are changed to tkmacos.
- Release-event binding cleanup is deferred to preserve click callbacks under
  Python 3.15.
- Build metadata is read without importing Tkinter.
- Tests and documentation are updated for the fork.
